# =============================================================================
# Argos HTTP User-Agent Database (http_ua.db)
# =============================================================================
# Syntax Format (Pipe-delimited):
# regex_pattern|OS_Name|Score|Device_Type|Vendor|Service_Name
#
# Fields Description:
# 1. regex_pattern  : The text string or regex pattern to match inside the 
#                     HTTP User-Agent header (automatically evaluated as lowercase).
# 2. OS_Name        : The identified operating system (e.g., Windows, Android, Tizen).
# 3. Score          : Confidence score (0 to 100). Higher scores take election 
#                     precedence when multiple signatures match.
# 4. Device_Type    : Categorization type (e.g., pc, phone, tv, console, media, generic).
# 5. Vendor         : Manufacturer or developer name (e.g., Microsoft, Sony, Samsung).
# 6. Service_Name   : Specific client, browser, or application name (e.g., Chrome, Kodi, PS5 Browser).
# =============================================================================
# Matching is performed against lowercase HTTP User-Agent.
# Higher Score takes precedence when multiple patterns match.
# Prefer specific patterns over broad ones.
# =============================================================================

